{"server":"cn","storyId":"act9d0_level_act9d0_04_end","groupId":"act9d0","stageId":"act9d0_06","title":"远遁","storyCode":"DM-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"6318f90c9369317440df07c7296c1c0554457b7ad02236b78ba0dd2d1a91d331","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"雇佣兵队伍转移的途中遭遇了天灾，被迫后退的途中，W依旧展现出她疯狂的态度想要观赏天灾——而这只是为了遮掩她与信使的会面。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"巴别塔发生了什么——但凡当时和特蕾西娅殿下有所联系的萨卡兹，都会有这个疑问。\nW无疑看清了真相，但在漫长的旅途中，她只字不谈。\n我没有问，伊内丝也没有，但我觉得她会比我更接近真相。\n不知不觉之间，我已经是走在最后的那个人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，不会有问题，各支队之间保持联络。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......遵命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，看来我们要在这里驻扎一阵子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"先遣队观察到了天灾云，没有天灾信使在这附近，以防万一，我们只能尽可能远离天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，不能冒这个风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......天灾吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"很少亲眼见识到在荒野肆虐的天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不过卡兹戴尔和源石打交道的历史也有很久了，倒是不至于那么慌乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......W呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"待在她自己的小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要去找她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不确定。W变了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为W会因为失去特蕾西娅而性情大变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"但她现在冷静得不像是W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不过先前在战场上找到她的时候，她确实还是那副玩世不恭的嘴脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"应该说比起过去有过之而无不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"真难得，你竟然能察觉到这种细微的违和感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......别讽刺我。如果W安静下来，那根本不算“细微”的违和感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"W她——啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_thundercloud"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"山的那一边，云在汇聚，气压的变化非常剧烈......那就是天灾云？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这个规模，可能驻扎在这里也是不安全的，通知所有支队，按原路线后撤五十公里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去找W，动作快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......别命令我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"W给我的感觉，和那个很像喔，现在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"W！你在干什么——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"这里——风好大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"还能干什么，欣赏天灾啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你疯了吗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？听——不——清——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，忘了你本来就是个疯子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"别让你手下的萨卡兹陪你一起送命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经让他们跟着赫德雷撤离了啦，我又不蠢——啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"W！你给我小心点！嘁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是别过来喔，摔下去你可受不了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你就受得了吗？你要是不想死就给我回来——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们两个搞什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你问她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"是她非要碍着我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"幸亏W的队伍没有损失，否则在与整合运动的领袖合流之前，我们就要先上一趟军事法庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"都先回去休息吧，等待通知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"在天灾中作战又怎么样？你害怕矿石病吗？害怕风暴吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是单纯的不想死于非命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都该提前适应一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"这会是种有趣的体验。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"伊内丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"别这样，我没生气，又不是小孩子吵架要你来回哄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"W她......把队伍安置得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"很难得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"很难得......我都不知道她是更疯了，还是......她......哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"她是个屁的天灾云，她就是个天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"（粗口......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼哼~哼哼~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你心情好像很不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"当然了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"有些消息，就是要离开卡兹戴尔那个破地方才能打听到啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这也不是你把见面地点定在天灾云下面的理由吧......你是要我的命吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，别这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道当一个疯子有什么好处吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不太想知道，但我其实已经知道了，毕竟我听你的，头儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"这就对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"好处就是，你做的事情越不合逻辑，就越不会遭人质疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛号的的确确离开了卡兹戴尔，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"准确来说，是没有情报表明这么大一艘舰船被殿......被特雷西斯纳入囊中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，还是有一些线索的嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"队伍中的生面孔越来越多，我反倒安心起来，对自己离开了卡兹戴尔有了实感。\n同行者里，有敌人，也有战友，总是这样反复无常。\n雇佣兵是不会在意过去的，因为我们就是这样一个异常容易放下生死的种族。\n又或者是因为那场战争结束得太快，我们立刻就投身了下一个战场，未曾品尝过哪怕一秒的和平。\n......或许这种希望也只是某种毒药，我们始终需要斗争和冲突来缓和其平衡。\nW就是最好的例子，她早已甘之如饴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"远道而来的战士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"战争从来不是什么可以逃避的事物。\n这我知道，当然知道，只是到那一刻，我终于意识到。\n战争早已弥漫在这片大地的每个角落，从每个意志相互独立的生命诞生开始。\n而我们再度深陷其中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
